<section class="bg-base-100 py-12 md:py-16">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:max-w-5xl">
    <div class="text-center">
      <%- include('../components/section_title', { text: 'Accommodation', level: 'h2' }) %>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-secondary/10 border border-secondary/20 p-4 mt-10">
      <div class="bg-base-100 p-5">
        <p class="text-justify text-body text-base-content/90">
          Limited hostel accommodation may be available for students and research scholars on a first-come, first-served basis. Participants requiring assistance may submit an accommodation request after registration. The organizing committee will provide guidance regarding nearby hotels and campus hostel availability; however, final booking and payment will remain the responsibility of the participant.
        </p>
